			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "怎麼認：「accelerates from rest」「climbs steadily」「spins down」\n「comes to a stop」「how many revolutions」；θ、ω₀、ω、α、t 給\n三求二。",
			"originalText": "怎麼認：「accelerates from rest」「climbs steadily」「spins down」\n「comes to a stop」「how many revolutions」；θ、ω₀、ω、α、t 給\n三求二。",
