			"updated": 1794554867194,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Connections: built from a_t = rα (10.5) and τ = rF sin θ (10.10).  Feeds K_rot = ½Iω² (10.4) and rolling (10.5).",
			"originalText": "Connections: built from a_t = rα (10.5) and τ = rF sin θ (10.10).  Feeds K_rot = ½Iω² (10.4) and rolling (10.5).",
